            <description><![CDATA[<h2>VoiceClaw Realtime Companion 0.1.131</h2><ul><li>Uses the supported OpenClaw Gateway protocol tied to the selected OpenClaw installation, with an exact-binary CLI fallback.</li><li>Supports legacy agents.list, current agents.entries, and mixed OpenClaw agent/session response shapes.</li><li>Keeps the selected model route separate from the actual OpenClaw agent and reports structured, retryable runtime errors.</li><li>Adds runtime capability negotiation for current iPhone and Apple Watch builds while preserving compatibility with older clients.</li></ul>
]]></description>
