            <description><![CDATA[<h2>VoiceClaw Realtime Companion 0.1.130</h2><ul><li>Adds durable concurrent route tasks with live status, steering, cancellation, and restart recovery.</li><li>Adds task-scoped input attachments and a bounded Companion-owned Artifact Inbox for returning files to iPhone.</li><li>Preserves QR/setup fields and explicitly selected credential families across schema v1, v2, and v3 regeneration.</li><li>Improves compatibility with current and legacy OpenClaw, Hermes, and Codex session response formats without modifying those installations.</li></ul>
]]></description>
